---
description: Prisma and migrations
globs: prisma/**,src/server/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Schema changes only via prisma migrate. Raw SQL (partial unique indexes) goes into the migration file.
- Add indexes for every filter/sort column used in lists and analytics.
- Use transactions for multi-step writes. Use select, never fetch whole rows needlessly.
- Seed script must be idempotent and run only when SEED_DEMO=true or NODE_ENV != production.
